聚焦通用能力建设与前沿问题研究。`},featured:{viewDetail:"查看详情"},moreModelTitle:"更多模型",viewMoreBtn:"查看更多"},Ym={home_v3:xm,common:Em,app:_m,header:Am,gallery:Sm,solutions:km,manage:Pm,approvals:Rm,commentReview:Nm,apply:Lm,review:Im,modelList:Tm,blog:Om,footer:Mm,detail:jm,openSourceDetail:Dm,forbid:Bm,notFound:Fm,form:Um,infiniteScroll:Hm,blogEdit:Vm,editor:zm,scan:qm,login:Wm,blogComment:Gm,editProfile:Km,personalCenter:Zm,aboutUs:Jm,openSource:Qm},$m={empty:{title:"Coming soon",desc:"Content is on the way"},common:{learnMore:"Learn More"},banner:{announcing:"Announcing",tryItNow:"Try it now",learnMore:"Learn More"},research:{title:"Research",desc:"With AGI as our long-term vision, we are committed to pushing the boundaries of intelligence and driving product innovation and scalable business applications through our large-model AI PaaS platform",read:"Read",publish:"Publish",tagResearch:"Research",tagRelease:"Release",seeAll:"View All"},partner:{title:"Co-design",desc:"Your Success Is Our Foundation. Our success is built on real breakthroughs in your business. We don't just provide model APIs—we deliver the AI infrastructure that powers the next generation of products.",seeAll:"View All",cooperateLabel:"Cooperate with hy："},direction:{title:"About us",seeAll:"View All",items:{llm:{name:"LLM",desc:"The Large Language Model Department is the core unit for the basic R&D and frontier exploration of the Hunyuan large language model. It focuses on the research and innovation of large language models and multimodal understanding models, and continuously promotes the evolution of model architectures, data and training strategies, reinforcement learning algorithms, and Agent capabilities."},aiData:{name:"AI Data",desc:"The AI Data Department is the core engine driving the evolution of large-model capabilities. We focus on creating a cutting-edge data ecosystem and evaluation system, building a full-chain intelligent data system covering evaluation optimization, data acquisition, intelligent cleaning, fine-grained annotation, AI-driven synthesis, experimental simulation, and stringent quality inspection. This ensures that top-quality data fuel is injected into the pre-training, fine-tuning, and practical applications of large models."},aiInfra:{name:"AI Infra",desc:"The AI Infra Department is responsible for the construction of technical capabilities of the large-model training and inference platform. It focuses on core technical capabilities such as large-scale distributed training and high-performance inference services, builds the core competitiveness of large-model AI Infra, and provides stable and efficient technical support and services for the R&D of large-model algorithms and the implementation of business scenarios."}}},model:{title:"More Model",seeAll:"View All",tryItNow:"Try it now"},join:{title:"Join Us",campus:"Campus Recruiting",experienced:"Experienced Hiring"}},Xm={langSwitchToEn:"Switch to English",langSwitchToZh:"Switch to Chinese",back:"Back",cancel:"Cancel",confirm:"Confirm",delete:"Delete",edit:"Edit",save:"Save",publish:"Publish",public:"Public",retry:"Retry",loading:"Loading...",noData:"No data available",allDataLoaded:"All data loaded",loadFailed:"Loading failed",unknownError:"Unknown error",editVersionTagEn:"EN VERSION",editVersionTagZh:"ZH VERSION",editVersionTitle:"Untitled Article",copied:"Copied",copy:"Copy",backToTop:"Back to top",copyFailed:"Copy failed, please copy manually",justGenerated:"Just generated",minutesAgo:"{{count}} min ago",hoursAgo:"{{count}} hrs ago",applyPublish:"Request Public Access",copySuccess:"Copied successfully",expandCode:"Expand Code",collapseCode:"Collapse Code",expandFullText:"Expand",collapse:"Collapse",rejectReasonTitle:"Approval a rejection reason",rejectReasonPlaceholder:"Enter the rejection reason",rejectReasonRequired:"Please provide a rejection reason",rejectReasonPrefix:"Rejection reason: ",rejectReasonEmpty:"No rejection reason",justNow:"Just now",confirmDelete:"Delete"},ev={noPermissio