adingQQ:"QQ login in progress, please wait...",bindSuccess:"Binding successful",bindFailed:"Binding failed, please try again",bindPhoneDialogTitle:"Phone number cannot be bound",bindPhoneDialogBody:"The phone number {{phone}} you want to bind is already bound to another account. Do you want to sign in with this phone number instead?",bindPhoneDialogChangePhone:"Change phone number",bindPhoneDialogUsePhone:"Sign in with this phone number",loginSuccess:"Login successful",loginFailed:"Login failed, please try again later",paramError:"Invalid parameters"},Cv={serviceAgreement:"User Service Agreement",privacyAgreement:"Privacy Agreement"},xv={comments:"Comments",submitComment:"Post comment",clickLoadMore:"Load More",submitSuccess:"Comment submitted. Visible once featured.",submitSuccessInner:"Comment submitted.",deleteSuccess:"Deleted",contentRequired:"Content cannot be empty",loadFailed:"Loading failed",reply:"Reply",deleteConfirmTitle:"Confirm",deleteConfirmBody:"Are you sure you want to delete this reply?",authorStatusFeatured:"Featured — visible to everyone",authorStatusFeaturedInner:"Visible to everyone",authorStatusNotFeatured:"Not featured — visible to author only"},Ev={title:"Edit Profile",imageFormatError:"Please upload JPG, PNG, WebP, BMP format images",imageSizeError:"Image size cannot exceed 10MB",imageReadError:"Image read failed, please try again",namePlaceholder:"Enter nickname",nameLabel:"Name",saving:"Saving...",submit:"Done",updateSuccess:"Profile updated",updateFailed:"Update failed"},_v={title:"Profile",accountSettings:"Account Settings",aboutUs:"About Us",feedback:"Feedback",userAgreement:"User Agreement",privacyPolicy:"Privacy Policy",logout:"Log Out",editProfile:"Edit Profile",closeAccount:"Delete Account",closeAccountDialogTitle:"Deleting your account will result in the following irreversible consequences",closeAccountDialogContent:`You can log in within a 7-day cooling-off period to cancel the deletion
After 7 days, your account will be permanently deleted, and all data under your Hy account will be lost
After deletion: even if you register again with the same email, it will be a brand-new account — previous data cannot be recovered`,closeAccountCancel:"Cancel",closeAccountConfirm:"Confirm Deletion",closeAccountFailed:"Failed to delete account. Please try again later.",restoreAccountSuccess:"Deletion canceled",restoreAccountFailed:"Failed to restore account. Please try again later.",accountDeletionPendingTitle:"Your account deletion request is being processed",accountDeletionEstimatedTime:"Estimated deletion date: {{time}}",accountDeletionFrozen:"Account features have been frozen",accountDeletionDataIrrecoverable:"All data will be permanently lost after deletion",accountDeletionRestoreTip:"To continue using this account, please restore it",accountDeletionCancelRestore:"Keep Deletion",accountDeletionRestore:"Restore Account"},Av={pageTitle:"About Us",introduction:"The Tencent Hy large model is a general-purpose large language model developed by Tencent, based on the Transformer architecture and employing a mixture of experts model technology, with a parameter scale in the trillions. It is fully developed in-house by Tencent and possesses capabilities for Chinese content creation, complex contextual logical reasoning, and task execution. This model was officially launched in September 2023, providing enterprise services through Tencent Cloud that include multimodal capabilities such as text generation, image creation, video generation, and 3D model generation.",sectionOneTitle:"Pushing the boundaries of AI through research, infrastructure and product innovation",cooperationTitle:"Our cooperation mode with the business",cooperationContent:'AI is entering a new phase. In this second half, the focus is shifting from "finding methods" to "finding problems." At the heart of this shift lies a balanced triangle of foundation, product, and frontier. What truly distinguishes large language models from earlier AI is their generalization across tasks and scenarios — allowing data and insights from different applications to reinforce one another. With the rise of AI agents, the interplay between environment, evaluation, reasoning, and action has become increasingly critical — arguably more so than raw model capability alone.It is precisely through this Co-Design of models and products that we continue to advance both scale and performance.',goalTitle:"Our goal is to build AI responsibly, for everyone",goalContent:"The Large Language Model is a general-purpose large language model developed by Tencent, based on the Transformer architecture and employing a The Tencent Hy large model is a general-purpose large language model developed by Tencent, based on the Transformer architecture and employing a",directionTitle:"Our Direction",cultureTitle:"CULTURE",openness:"Openness",opennessDesc:"AI Companion Function. Desktop Pets Add Fun. Dozens of lovely cute pets are available as desktop companions, with interactive actions such as",collaboration:"Collaboration",collaborationDesc:"AI Companion Function. Desktop Pets Add Fun. Dozens of lovely cute pets are available as desktop companions, with interactive actions such as",solid:"Solid",solidDesc:"AI Companion Function. Desktop Pets Add Fun. Dozens of lovely cute pets are available as desktop companions, with interactive actions such as",joinUsTitle:"Join Us",campusRecruiting:"Campus Recruiting",experiencedHiring:"Experienced Hiring"},Sv={heroBanner:{title:`Open 
